  "body": "This seems to be caused by only checking the database for aliases for the room. See synapse.storage.directory.py:L145 and synapse.handlers.appservice:L145 -- we should also be checking the m.room.aliases list. Update docs on the storage method to make it clear that only local aliases will be returned.\n\n(Imported from https://matrix.org/jira/browse/SYN-400)\n\n(Reported by @Kegsay)",
